===Etymology 1===
After {{w|Kongo}}, from {{der|en|kg|nkongo||hunter}}. Compare {{cog|kg|dikongo||spear}}, {{cog|zu|umkhonto}}, {{cog|bnt-pro|*mʊ̀kóndó}}.

